    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d741">

                <pb facs="0845" n="757" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg757"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs Mr. McCormick to ascertain upon what principle the 66 cases of
                    machinery and 4 girders, part of the cargo of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Arabia</hi>, were condemned, if at all.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
